1
00:00:02,635 --> 00:00:09,435
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:09,936 --> 00:00:11,896
(Sheldon:)Amy?

3
00:00:11,897 --> 00:00:13,797
(Sheldon:)Wake up.

4
00:00:13,799 --> 00:00:16,499
Wh... What's wrong?

5
00:00:16,501 --> 00:00:18,271
(Sheldon:)It's midnight.

6
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:19,770
(Sheldon:)Happy birthday.

7
00:00:19,771 --> 00:00:22,971
(Scene:)Sheldon.

8
00:00:27,279 --> 00:00:32,179
(Amy:)Okay, you can have
this back in the morning.

9
00:00:32,184 --> 00:00:35,154
(Sheldon:)This is for you.

10
00:00:35,153 --> 00:00:36,523
(Sheldon:)I was going to wrap it,

11
00:00:36,521 --> 00:00:39,391
(Sheldon:)but touching Scotch tape
gives me the heebie-jeebies.

12
00:00:39,391 --> 00:00:42,861
(Amy:)I'll put in on the list
with peaches and felt.

13
00:00:44,529 --> 00:00:46,599
(Amy:)What is this?

14
00:00:46,598 --> 00:00:50,068
(Sheldon:)A functional MRI
of my brain.

15
00:00:50,068 --> 00:00:54,138
(Sheldon:)I did Sudoku before they
took it so I'd be ripped.

16
00:00:54,139 --> 00:00:57,169
(Amy:)I love it. Thank you.

17
00:00:57,175 --> 00:00:58,475
(Sheldon:)And it's not just an MRI.

18
00:00:58,477 --> 00:01:00,047
(Sheldon:)The orbitofrontal
cortex is lit up

19
00:01:00,045 --> 00:01:02,245
(Sheldon:)because I was
thinking of you.

